<title>UK: First leisure says 4-month underlying trading broadly.</title>
<headline>First leisure says 4-month underlying trading broadly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's First Leisure Corp Plc said on Tuesday underlying trading in the first four months of its current financial year was broadly unchanged from the second half of the previous year ended October 31.</p>
<p>&quot;Underlying trading in the first four months of this financial year has broadly continued the patterns experienced in the second half of last financial year,' chairman Michael Grade told the group's AGM on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
